{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien fleet pierces the atmosphere, its warships blotting out the sun. Cities crumble, defenses fall, and the planet teeters on the brink of annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are humanity\u2019s last line of defense. One pilot. One ship. One chance to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbital Siege</strong> fuses the classic arcade shooters with planetary defense, delivering relentless action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Intense Shoot-'em-up Action:</strong> Survive escalating enemy waves and take down bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Upgrade &amp; Defend:</strong> Boost firepower, speed, and shields with power-ups. Block enemy fire with defensive orbs, hunt foes with devastating lasers and homing missiles, and activate planetary turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Dodge &amp; Weave:</strong> Slip through storms of enemy fire with sharp precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Pixel Retro Style:</strong> Vibrant pixel art that celebrates the golden age of arcade gaming.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556690?t=1774102129","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556690?t=1774102129","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556690/790886393cbe11ee7272d7ec60c28501930d5b13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774102129","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556690/790886393cbe11ee7272d7ec60c28501930d5b13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774102129","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"contr